{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！橋本です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日リハでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにお知らせ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週、9月3日発売のプレイボーイに\n橋本のソログラビアが載ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもナチュラルな感じに撮って戴きました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ソロでのグラビアは\n初めてなのですよ〜(o^_^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非チェックしていただきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のリハ中\n突き指して爪折れた(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてレッスンの合間の食事中\n舌噛んだ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"情けねぇよぉ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今日は飛鳥が\n「ななみー♪」って言って\n走って抱き付いてきたから良い一日だった♪\nってことにしとこ！＼(^o^)／笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまたね！ばあい！"}],"source":"archive"}